      "rank": 3,
      "rarity": "uncommon",
      "traits": [],
      "traditions": [],
      "description": "You and the secondary casters weave together spells (and, if anadis, silk) in a complex ritual that combines magical learning with art, allowing all the participants to share spells they know with one another.\nSuccess You or any secondary caster can swap any spell in your spell repertoire for a spell in the spell repertoire of any other participant. This spell can't be a higher level than the ritual's level.\nFailure None of the participants can swap spells.\nCritical Failure As failure, and all participants are Stupefied 1 for 24 hours and can't reduce their stupefied condition below 1 for 24 hours.",
